==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Don't waste your good meatshields here just because there's a Rain D, it's at a decently low magnification and is the only somewhat threatening enemy in the stage. Might as well bring some of your less useful collab units and use them as fodder here.

